alinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T09:10:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T09:10:30Z","body":"I did test it with Quest 3 controllers through Meta Link, where in my case palm bone position is (0, 0, 0) relative to Skeleton3D instead of where it should be.\n\nNot sure if this is the same category of error, but unfortunately, it's **NOT** fixed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767238576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767645995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113752#issuecomment-3767645995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113752","id":3767645995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gkbcr","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","f