/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T10:42:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T10:45:14Z","body":"> Hmmmm, thats the first I've heard of Meta Link having this issue, but that gives me something to try.\n\nIt might be because nobody else is doing it? Palm bone is not used in SkeletonProfileHumanoid, so I assume everyone only has RightHand/LeftHand bones in their hand skeletons - and these work.\n\n> Interesting you got meta link to work though because it currently has a major tracking bug when running OpenXR 1.1.54... Maybe that only applies in certain reference spaces... hmmm\n\nNo, I still have the bug. I just power through flicker or swivel my headset up to look on the monitor where it's not flickering :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767656486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]